event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/plan.md\", \"content\": \"Plan for mission \\\"greet, tested\\\":\\n\\n1. Dispatch to dev: implement src/greet.py with greet(name) -\u003e \\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\",\\n   and tests/test_greet.py covering a normal name and the empty string, verified\\n   locally with `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exiting 0. Commit to dev's\\n   own branch.\\n2. Wait for dev's reply.\\n3. Judge: fetch dev's branch, inspect src/greet.py and tests/test_greet.py,\\n   re-run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` myself against the fetched tree\\n   to confirm exit 0, and confirm both required test cases (normal name, empty\\n   string) are actually present and meaningful (not vacuous).\\n4. Accept if all three criteria met; otherwise send precise rework.\\n5. Reply to mission m1 with outcome once resolved.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

